--------------
 - phyboard-maia-am335x-1 
 - phyboard-maia-am335x-3 (only boot tests)
 - phyboard-wega-am335x-1 (only boot tests)
 - phyboard-wega-am335x-2 (only boot tests)
 - phyboard-wega-am335x-3
 - phyboard-wega-am335x-4 (only boot tests)
 - phycore-am335x-1
 - phycore-am335x-2 (only boot tests)
 - phycore-am335x-3 (only boot tests)
 - phycore-am335x-4 (only boot tests)
 - phycore-am335x-5 (only boot tests)
 - phycore-am335x-6 (only boot tests)
 - phycore-am335x-7 (only boot tests)
 - phyflex-am335x-1
 
Tested Yocto Images:
--------------------
 - phytec-qt5demo-image
 
Build Environment:
------------------
 - Ubuntu 14.04 64Bit
 
Features:
------------------
 - Added support for new machines:
        * phyboard-maia-am335x-2
        * phyboard-maia-am335x-3
        * phyboard-wega-am335x-3
        * phyboard-wega-am335x-4
        * phycore-am335x-3
        * phycore-am335x-4
        * phycore-am335x-5
        * phycore-am335x-6
        * phycore-am335x-7
        * phyflex-am335x-2
        * phyflex-am335x-3
        * phyflex-am335x-4
 
 - Added following features:
        * Support for Wifi Expansion PEB-B-001.A2, PEB-WLBT-01.A2 and PCM-958
        * Added support for Maia SD-Card expansion PEB-C-004.A0
        * Added support for RS485 (phyboard-maia-am335x-3)
        * Added support for new displays:
            * LCD-018-035-KAP 
            * LCD-018-043-KAP
            * LCD-018-057-KAP
        * Added support for resistive touch on different machines, except phyFLEX-AM335x
        * Updated edt touch driver to support new firmware version
        * Support basic EMMC handling (added EMMC image, added tool to change extended registers in bootloader, added update handler for raw mmc images)
        * Added watchdog support (Only enabled in bootloader as default, see documentation)
        * Add support for ethernet boot
        * Add support for Audio WM8974 Codec on PCM-953
 
- Issues Fixed:
       * Disabled crypto module due to buggy behaviour
       * Added workaround for SMSC link detection issue
 
Known Issues:
-----------------------------------
 
 - phycore-am335x-som: 
        * Boottests showed in about 2 of 2000 boots that the SMSC LAN8710 phy could not be found.
          The PHY ID readout is wrong. The generic PHY driver will take over. Ethernet is still functional is this case.
 
 - phyboard-maia-am335x-1:
	* digital IO inputs do not work with CB Version 1403.2
 
 - phyflex-am335x-1: 
	* line in has high distortion
